{"suttaId":"an8.53","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-viii","vriCode":"s0404m1.mul","paras":[711,713],"vripara":"53"},"segments":{"an8.53:0.3":"Saṃkhittasuttaṃ","an8.53:1.1":"[cūḷava.406] Ekaṃ samayaṃ bhagavā vesāliyaṃ viharati mahāvane kūṭāgārasālāyaṃ.","an8.53:1.2":"Atha kho mahāpajāpatī gotamī yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṃ abhivādetvā ekamantaṃ aṭṭhāsi. Ekamantaṃ ṭhitā kho sā mahāpajāpatī gotamī bhagavantaṃ etadavoca –","an8.53:2.1":"“Sādhu me, bhante, bhagavā saṃkhittena dhammaṃ desetu, yamahaṃ bhagavato dhammaṃ sutvā ekā vūpakaṭṭhā appamattā ātāpinī pahitattā vihareyyan”ti.","an8.53:2.2":"“Ye kho tvaṃ, gotami, dhamme jāneyyāsi –","an8.53:2.3":"‘ime dhammā sarāgāya saṃvattanti, no virāgāya;","an8.53:2.4":"saṃyogāya saṃvattanti, no visaṃyogāya;","an8.53:2.5":"ācayāya saṃvattanti, no apacayāya;","an8.53:2.6":"mahicchatāya saṃvattanti, no appicchatāya;","an8.53:2.7":"asantuṭṭhiyā saṃvattanti, no santuṭṭhiyā;","an8.53:2.8":"saṅgaṇikāya saṃvattanti, no pavivekāya;","an8.53:2.9":"kosajjāya saṃvattanti, no vīriyārambhāya;","an8.53:2.10":"dubbharatāya saṃvattanti, no subharatāyā’ti, ekaṃsena, gotami, dhāreyyāsi –","an8.53:2.12":"‘neso dhammo, neso vinayo, netaṃ satthusāsanan’”ti.","an8.53:3.1":"“Ye ca kho tvaṃ, gotami, dhamme jāneyyāsi –","an8.53:3.2":"‘ime dhammā virāgāya saṃvattanti, no sarāgāya;","an8.53:3.3":"visaṃyogāya saṃvattanti, no saṃyogāya;","an8.53:3.4":"apacayāya saṃvattanti, no ācayāya;","an8.53:3.5":"appicchatāya saṃvattanti, no mahicchatāya;","an8.53:3.6":"santuṭṭhiyā saṃvattanti, no asantuṭṭhiyā;","an8.53:3.7":"pavivekāya saṃvattanti, no saṅgaṇikāya;","an8.53:3.8":"vīriyārambhāya saṃvattanti, no kosajjāya;","an8.53:3.9":"subharatāya saṃvattanti, no dubbharatāyā’ti, ekaṃsena, gotami, dhāreyyāsi –","an8.53:3.11":"‘eso dhammo, eso vinayo, etaṃ satthusāsanan’”ti.","an8.53:3.12":"Tatiyaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Mp-viii","bookName":"Aṭṭhakanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0404a.att","from":185,"to":185,"paras":[{"para":185,"vripara":"53","refs":["an8.53:2","an8.53:3"],"lines":["Tatiye <b>sarāgāyā</b>ti sarāgatthāya.","<b>Virāgāyā</b>ti virajjanatthāya.","<b>Saṃyogāyā</b>ti vaṭṭe saṃyogatthāya.","<b>Visaṃyogāyā</b>ti vaṭṭe visaṃyogabhāvatthāya.","<b>Ācayāyā</b>ti vaṭṭassa vaḍḍhanatthāya.","<b>No apacayāyā</b>ti na vaṭṭaviddhaṃsanatthāya.","<b>Dubbharatāyā</b>ti dupposanatthāya.","<b>No subharatāyā</b>ti na sukhaposanatthāya.","Imasmiṃ sutte paṭhamavārena vaṭṭaṃ kathitaṃ, dutiyavārena vivaṭṭaṃ kathitaṃ.","Iminā ca pana ovādena gotamī arahattaṃ pattāti."],"lineRefs":[["an8.53:2"],["an8.53:2"],["an8.53:2"],["an8.53:2"],["an8.53:2"],["an8.53:2"],["an8.53:2"],["an8.53:2"],["an8.53:2"],["an8.53:2"]]}],"wordLinks":[["an8.53:2.3","sarāgāyā",0,0],["an8.53:2.3","virāgāyā",0,1],["an8.53:2.4","saṃyogāyā",0,2],["an8.53:2.4","visaṃyogāyā",0,3],["an8.53:2.5","ācayāyā",0,4],["an8.53:2.5","no apacayāyā",0,5],["an8.53:2.10","dubbharatāyā",0,6],["an8.53:2.10","no subharatāyā",0,7]]},"tika":null}
